  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "The last gold seat",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-21-2147-arc-2-matu997-takes-last-gold-place"
      ],
      "text": "matu997 moved from 18th to 16th at 66.53, a gain of 2.22, and now holds the sixteenth and last provisional gold place. The gold line itself rose 0.97 in the past day to match that score. NguyenThanhNhan, 17th at 65.97, is 0.56 short and is the first team outside gold, with ibyyue, artificialagencylab.com and 大阪公立大学 shiiin9 tied behind at 65.56. These public medal bands remain provisional."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The summit and the Raiders",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "The top of the table did not move. Tufa Labs leads at 88.06, Yi-Chia Chen is second at 84.72, and rabbithole and nvbanana follow at 80.83 and 79.72, with the top ten unchanged. ARC Raiders edged from 68.33 to 68.75 with an overnight event and holds 13th, 2.22 above the gold line. ARC Mutants held 61st at 39.31, also unchanged."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Climbers into the top hundred",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-21-2147-arc-2-kibuna-climbs-to-thirty-first",
        "wire-2026-10-21-2147-arc-2-jay-gautam-climbs-to-ninety-sixth"
      ],
      "text": "The overnight action sat well below the medals. Giba rose from 199th to 93rd on an event that lifted the score from 32.36 to 34.44, above the provisional silver cutoff of 32.64. The wire reported kibuna up from 55th to 31st at 54.72 after a gain of 14.16, and Jay Gautam up 1,751 places from 1847th to 96th at 34.03 on a gain of 6.25. Yuvraj #2 rose from 279th to 90th at 34.86 and parkera from 431st to 103rd at 33.61. Score events are context rather than net daily gains, and the social scan was not refreshed for this edition, so the account rests on the public board and the wire."
    }
